      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The brainchild of Edmonton drummers Tony Flanagan and Braeden Detert, Quiddity is an experimental double-drum project resulting from the duo's willingness to delve into a new and challenging improvisational landscape."
      }
    ],
