        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Elizabeth is too under the weather to travel and is hugely disappointed, but Michael & Tony are going to forge ahead and present a compelling program of straight-up jazz, fusion, and maybe a little bit of Jeff Beck."
      }
    ],
