        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "SOLD OUT Matinee: The Jivin' Belles Christmas - The Yardbird Suite"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Formed in 2013 through a shared love of vintage fashion and the iconic 1940s vocal group The Andrews Sisters, The Jivin' Belles has spent the past decade lending their retro flair to charity concerts, private events, swing dances, drag shows, artisan markets, arts festivals and more, performing throughout Edmonton, Alberta, and throughout the Canadian Prairies."
      }
    ],
