        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This winter be sure to come cozy up at the Yardbird Suite for another rendition of Nanise’s Next Nice n Naughty Holiday Cabaret, a splendid evening of chosen family &amp; friendships woven together via music, poetry, drag, and burlesque."
