        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Lisi Sings Lhasa is a heartfelt tribute to the luminous songwriting of the late Lhasa de Sela, performed by Canadian vocalist Lisi Sommer and an all-star ensemble of folk, jazz, and world musicians."
      }
